/-!
# Direct gravity-auxiliary obstruction after the Cartan connection write

This regression computes the repaired-action Cartan connection before any
gravity reaction is reinstalled.  The resulting `delta B` residual is read
from the live derived curvature of that same actual.  Thus a nonzero
coordinate is an independent failure control for the connection-only epoch,
not a residual value supplied to the connection producer and not a failure of
the Cartan torsion--spin construction.

The later reaction installer may use this obstruction to open a new epoch.
After that write, `delta B = 0` will be producer soundness rather than a second
independent constraint.
-/

